    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d5ff79d8-6acc-5aee-8760-903575464356" activityNameId="62163e03-e087-5666-821d-f739046c17f8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation duct, stainless steel, s= 1.5mm, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation duct, stainless steel, s= 1.5mm, at plant
Production of a rectangular ventilation duct, made of stainless steel sheet, sheet thickness 1.5 mm, total weight: 15.3 kg/m2. Including average material for joining profile, slide profile, bolt clamps to join components. Stiffening profiles or internal rods to decrease the bulging and caving of the duct. Suspension profile with EPDM shock absorbing rubber, channels, channel brackets and cantilevers for fixation on walls or ceilings.;
UUID: 7cf88dde-69be-3a0a-a60f-aff4895545d9
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7cf88dde-69be-3a0a-a60f-aff4895545d9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
